msgid "減衰比。0〜2。1が臨界減衰。"
msgstr "Damping ratio. 0 to 2. 1 is critical damping."

msgid "目標からの最大差分。正の値。"
msgstr "Maximum difference from target. Positive value."

msgid "各目標へ遅れて追従する結果。"
msgstr "The result of following each target with a delay."

msgid "初期値は先頭目標、初速ゼロ。内部刻みを細分化する半陰的Euler法。 回転に使う場合は角度のラップを呼出側で処理する。"
msgstr "The initial value is the first target, with zero initial velocity. The implicit Euler method is used for internal time stepping. When used for rotation, angle wrapping must be handled by the caller."

