msgstr "Common base for vertices, edges, faces, UVs, and curve CVs. Use a concrete type such as Vertex. The supplied Shape wrapper is shared; no geometry or coordinate copy is stored. The index is validated at construction, but is not guaranteed to identify the same element after a topology change. UV index bounds follow the current UV set."

