msgstr "``prefix[start]`` or ``prefix[start:end]``."

msgid "操作の標準単数型。"
msgstr "The standard single-component class for this operation."

msgid "単数・反復・シェイプが標準の実装ならTrue。"
msgstr "True if single components, iteration, and the shape use standard implementations."

