msgid "class mlib.components.pointComponent.PointComponent"
msgstr "class mlib.components.pointComponent.PointComponent"

msgid "Shape参照と頂点/CV番号を保持し、現在のXYZ座標を照会・編集する。"
msgstr "Hold a Shape reference and a vertex/CV index to query and edit current XYZ coordinates."

