msgstr ""

msgid "Z成分だけを設定し、他の成分を維持する。"
msgstr "Set only the Z component and keep the other components unchanged."

msgid "Shapeと番号を検証してOpenMayaへ問い合わせる。UIの距離単位には換算しない。"
msgstr "Validate the Shape and index before querying OpenMaya. Values are not converted to UI distance units."

msgid "Trueは保持DAGパスのworld空間、FalseはShapeのobject空間。短縮名ws。"
msgstr "True uses world space for the held DAG path; False uses the Shape's object space. The short name is ws."

msgid "worldSpaceの別名。同時指定は不可。"
msgstr "Alias for worldSpace. Do not specify both names together."

msgid "新しいXYZ値。シーン内座標への書換え可能な参照ではない。"
msgstr "New XYZ values, not a writable reference to coordinates in the scene."

msgid "worldSpaceがbool以外の場合。"
msgstr "If worldSpace is not a bool."

msgid "Shapeが無効、またはMayaが座標取得を拒否した場合。"
msgstr "If the Shape is invalid or Maya refuses to read its coordinates."

msgid "Trueはワールド空間、Falseはローカル空間。短縮名ws。"
msgstr "True means world space, False means local space. Short name ws."

msgid "座標値。"
msgstr "Coordinate values."

msgid "通常経路は現在のUI距離単位へ換算してcmds.xformへ渡す。fastは入力履歴・周期カーブ・ Shape/対象点のロックや入力接続を検査してからOpenMayaで更新する。 CVのwは維持する。共有Shapeの編集は他のインスタンスにも影響する。"
msgstr "The normal path converts values to current UI distance units for cmds.xform. fast checks input history, periodic curves, and Shape/target-point locks and input connections before updating through OpenMaya. CV w is preserved. Editing a shared Shape also affects its other instances."

msgid "cm単位の有限なXYZ。移動量ではない。"
msgstr "Finite XYZ coordinates in cm, not a displacement."

msgid "TrueはUndoなしの直接更新。Undo設定は変更しない。"
msgstr "True performs direct updates without Undo, without changing the Undo setting."

msgid "自身。通常経路はUndoが有効なら変更を記録する。"
msgstr "Self. The normal path records changes when Undo is enabled."

msgid "座標・空間指定が不正、または逆変換が必要な経路でworld行列が特異な場合。"
msgstr "If coordinates or the space flag are invalid, or the world matrix is singular on a path that requires inverse transformation."

msgid "fastがbool以外の場合。"
msgstr "If fast is not a bool."

msgid "番号が現在の範囲外の場合。"
msgstr "If the index is outside the current bounds."

msgid "対象が無効・書込み不可、またはMayaが更新を拒否した場合。"
msgstr "If the target is invalid or not writable, or Maya refuses the update."

msgid "fastで入力履歴付きShapeまたは周期カーブを編集する場合。"
msgstr "If a fast edit targets a Shape with input history or a periodic curve."

msgid "通常Meshのworld更新はMayaコマンドへ委譲し、独自の特異行列判定は行わない。 APIの書込み・更新中の失敗で、完了済み変更を自動ロールバックする保証はない。"
msgstr "Normal world-space Mesh updates delegate to the Maya command without a custom singular-matrix check. Failures during API writes or updates are not guaranteed to roll back completed changes automatically."

msgid "有限な座標。"
msgstr "Finite coordinates."

msgid "TrueはOpenMaya直接更新（Undoなし）。既定False。"
msgstr "True means direct OpenMaya update (no Undo). Default is False."

msgid "更新した自身。"
msgstr "Updated by oneself."

msgid "座標・空間指定または要素数が不正な場合。"
msgstr "Invalid coordinate, space specification, or element count."

msgid "fastがboolでない場合。"
msgstr "when fast is not bool"

msgid "対象が無効、またはMayaが更新を拒否した場合。"
msgstr "The target is invalid or Maya rejected the update."

msgid "fast更新で未対応の形状の場合。"
msgstr "In case of shapes that are not supported by fast update."

msgid "class mlib.components.pointComponent.PointComponents"
msgstr "class mlib.components.pointComponent.PointComponents"

msgid "同一Shapeの頂点/CV番号列を保持し、保持順にXYZ座標を照会・一括編集する。"
msgstr "Store vertex/CV indices on one Shape and query or edit XYZ coordinates in stored order."

msgid "座標値は保持せず、getPositionで現在値を取得する。XYZはcm単位で、 setPositionは全要素に同じ絶対座標、setPositionsは番号ごとの座標行を設定する。"
msgstr "Coordinate values are not stored; getPosition reads current values. XYZ is in cm. setPosition assigns the same absolute coordinates to all elements, whereas setPositions assigns a coordinate row to each index."

msgid ":py:obj:`getPosition <mlib.components.pointComponent.PointComponents.getPosition>`\\ \\(\\[worldSpace\\, ws\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "保持番号の順に、頂点/CVの現在のXYZ座標をcmで取得する。"
msgstr "Get current vertex/CV XYZ coordinates in cm, in stored-index order."

msgid ":py:obj:`getPositionX <mlib.components.pointComponent.PointComponents.getPositionX>`\\ \\(\\[worldSpace\\, ws\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid ":py:obj:`getPositionY <mlib.components.pointComponent.PointComponents.getPositionY>`\\ \\(\\[worldSpace\\, ws\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

