msgstr "Whether to validate defaults before registration in the normal path as well. False in the fast path, which validates while building unregistered parent and child definitions."

msgid "mlib.core.attributeType"
msgstr ""

msgid "アトリビュートの型名を Maya API 2.0 のアトリビュート定義から求める(シーンを変更しない)。"
msgstr "Get the attribute type name from the Maya API 2.0 attribute definition (does not modify the scene)."

msgid "Plug の派生クラスの選択(:class:`~mlib.core.registry.NodeRegistry` のアトリビュート型キー)と、 ``Plug.set()`` の配列型の判定に使う型名を、``cmds.getAttr(<プラグ名>, type=True)`` と 同じ文字列で返す。``cmds.getAttr(type=True)`` は存在しない配列要素を問い合わせると 要素を作り(blendShape の ``weight[i]`` では ``parentDirectory[i]`` なども作られる)、 nurbsSurface の ``patchUVIds`` の存在しない要素では Maya が異常終了し、mesh の内部アトリビュート (``edge[i]``・``face[i]`` など)では例外になる。この関数はプラグの値を読まず、 アトリビュート定義(``MFnAttribute`` の各派生クラス)だけから型名を決めるため、存在しない要素でも シーンを変更せず、評価も起こさない。"
msgstr "Return the type name used to select a Plug subclass (the attribute-type key in :class:`~mlib.core.registry.NodeRegistry`) and identify array types in ``Plug.set()``, using the same strings as ``cmds.getAttr(<プラグ名>, type=True)``. Querying a nonexistent array element with ``cmds.getAttr(type=True)`` creates the element; blendShape ``weight[i]`` also creates related elements such as ``parentDirectory[i]``. Querying nonexistent elements of nurbsSurface ``patchUVIds`` can crash Maya, while internal mesh attributes such as ``edge[i]`` and ``face[i]`` raise exceptions. This function determines the type name solely from the attribute definition (the subclasses of ``MFnAttribute``), without reading the plug value. It therefore neither changes the scene nor triggers evaluation, even for nonexistent elements."

msgid "アトリビュートの種類と結果:"
msgstr "Attribute types and results:"

msgid "アトリビュート"
msgstr "attribute"

msgid "結果"
msgstr "Results"

msgid "数値(``MFnNumericAttribute``)"
msgstr "numeric(``MFnNumericAttribute``)"

msgid "``bool``/``byte``/``char``/``short``/``long``/``float``/``double``/``addr`` と、 複合数値の ``double3``/``float3``/``long2`` など(``numericType()`` による)"
msgstr "``bool``/``byte``/``char``/``short``/``long``/``float``/``double``/``addr`` and composite values such as ``double3``/``float3``/``long2`` (by ``numericType()``)"

msgid "単位(``MFnUnitAttribute``)"
msgstr "Unit(``MFnUnitAttribute``)"

msgid "``doubleLinear``/``floatLinear``/``doubleAngle``/``floatAngle``/``time``"
msgstr "``doubleLinear``/``floatLinear``/``doubleAngle``/``floatAngle``/``time``"

msgid "enum・message"
msgstr "enum, message"

msgid "``enum``・``message``"
msgstr "``enum``, ``message``"

msgid "行列(``MFnMatrixAttribute``)"
msgstr "matrix(``MFnMatrixAttribute``)"

msgid "``matrix`` (float の行列も ``cmds.getAttr`` と同じく ``matrix``)"
msgstr "``matrix`` (same as ``cmds.getAttr`` for float matrices, ``matrix``)"

msgid "型付き(``MFnTypedAttribute``)"
msgstr "Typed (``MFnTypedAttribute``)"

msgid "``string``/``matrix``/``doubleArray``/``Int32Array``/``mesh``/``nurbsCurve`` など。 API 2.0 に列挙値の無いデータ型(``Int64Array``・``floatVectorArray``・ データ型指定の ``double3`` など)は ``MFnAttribute.getAddAttrCmd()`` のデータ型名"
msgstr "``string``/``matrix``/``doubleArray``/``Int32Array``/``mesh``/``nurbsCurve``, etc. Data types without enumeration values in API 2.0 (such as ``Int64Array``, ``floatVectorArray``, and data type specification ``double3``) are named ``MFnAttribute.getAddAttrCmd()``."

msgid "複合(``MFnCompoundAttribute``)・lightData"
msgstr "Composite(``MFnCompoundAttribute``), lightData"

msgid "``TdataCompound``"
msgstr "``TdataCompound``"

msgid "不透明(opaque)"
msgstr "opaque"

msgid "``getAddAttrCmd()`` のアトリビュート型名(``TattributeCtypeOf<...>``)"
msgstr "``getAddAttrCmd()`` attribute type name (``TattributeCtypeOf<...>``)"

msgid "保持する値によって ``cmds.getAttr(type=True)`` の結果が変わるアトリビュート(generic アトリビュート、 任意のデータを受け付ける typed アトリビュート、``geometry`` 型など)は、値を読まない限り 型名が決まらないため ``None`` を返す。"
msgstr "Depending on the value to be retained, the result of ``cmds.getAttr(type=True)`` for attributes (generic attributes, typed attributes that accept any data, ``geometry`` type, etc.) is undetermined until the value is read, so it returns ``None``."

msgid "例外として、mesh の ``controlPoints`` はアトリビュート定義が ``double3`` でも、Maya が内部で float の頂点座標として扱い ``cmds.getAttr(type=True)`` が ``float3`` を返すため、 ``float3`` を返す(nurbsCurve・nurbsSurface・lattice は ``double3``)。"
msgstr "As an exception, the ``controlPoints`` of mesh is such that even if the attribute definition is ``double3``, Maya internally treats the vertex coordinates as float and ``cmds.getAttr(type=True)`` returns ``float3``, thus returning ``float3`` (nurbsCurve, nurbsSurface, lattice are ``double3``)."

msgid ":py:obj:`attributeType <mlib.core.attributeType.attributeType>`\\ \\(mplug\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "プラグのアトリビュート型名を、``cmds.getAttr(<プラグ名>, type=True)`` と同じ文字列で返す。"
msgstr "Returns the attribute type name of a plug as a string identical to ``cmds.getAttr(<プラグ名>, type=True)``."

msgid ":py:obj:`is_internal_data_type <mlib.core.attributeType.is_internal_data_type>`\\ \\(mplug\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Maya 内部のデータ型(``cmds.addAttr`` で作成できない型)の型付きアトリビュートか判定する。"
msgstr "Check if the attribute is a typed attribute of a data type that cannot be created with ``cmds.addAttr``."

msgid ":py:obj:`value_reader <mlib.core.attributeType.value_reader>`\\ \\(attribute\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "``Plug.get()`` が MPlug から直接値を読む関数を、アトリビュート定義から選ぶ。"
msgstr "Select the function used by ``Plug.get()`` to read values directly from MPlug, based on the attribute definition."

msgid "アトリビュート定義だけから求めるため、存在しない配列要素や、``cmds.getAttr`` が例外になる mesh の内部アトリビュートにも使え、シーンを変更しない。配列プラグは要素の型名を返す (``cmds.getAttr(type=True)`` を配列全体に使った結果とは異なる)。規則はモジュールの 説明を参照。"
msgstr "Since it is calculated from the attribute definition alone, it can be used even for non-existent array elements and internal mesh attributes where ``cmds.getAttr`` would otherwise raise an exception, and it does not modify the scene. For array plugs, it returns the type name of the elements (the result differs from using ``cmds.getAttr(type=True)`` on the entire array). Refer to the module's description for the rules."

msgid "対象のプラグ。"
msgstr "Target plug."

msgid "``double3``/``doubleLinear``/``matrix`` などの型名。値によって型が     変わるアトリビュート(generic アトリビュートなど)は None。"
msgstr "Type names such as ``double3``/``doubleLinear``/``matrix``. For generic attributes (such as generic attributes), where the type changes depending on the value, use None."

msgid "``double3``/``doubleLinear``/``matrix`` などの型名。値によって型が"
msgstr "Type names such as ``double3``/``doubleLinear``/``matrix``. The type is determined by the value."

msgid "変わるアトリビュート(generic アトリビュートなど)は None。"
msgstr "For generic attributes (such as generic attributes), the value is None."

msgid "アトリビュートが削除されて存在しない場合(Undo の対象から外れた削除済みの 動的アトリビュートなど)。"
msgstr "An attribute that has been deleted and no longer exists (such as a dynamically added attribute that was deleted and is no longer part of the undo history)."

msgid "nurbsSurface の ``patchUVIds`` (``nurbsPatchUVIds``)のような内部のデータ型は、 存在しない配列要素の値や型を maya.cmds・MPlug で読むと Maya が異常終了する場合がある。 mlibはこれらの存在しない要素の値を読まず、``Plug.get()`` でRuntimeErrorにする。 要素の参照取得だけでは値を評価しない。任意のデータを受け付ける 型付きアトリビュート(値によって型が変わるアトリビュート)は対象外。"
msgstr "Reading the value or type of a nonexistent array element with maya.cmds or MPlug can crash Maya for internal data types such as nurbsSurface's ``patchUVIds`` (``nurbsPatchUVIds``). mlib does not read values from these nonexistent elements; ``Plug.get()`` raises RuntimeError instead. Retrieving an element reference alone does not evaluate its value. Typed attributes accepting arbitrary data, whose type depends on the value, are excluded."

msgid "内部のデータ型の型付きアトリビュートの場合は True。"
msgstr "True for typed attribute of internal data type."

msgid "関数を選ぶだけで値は読み取らない。呼出元のPlugが読取関数を保持し、 getのたびに現在値を取得する。"
msgstr "Only selects a function without reading values. The calling Plug retains the reader function and retrieves the current value on each get call."

msgid "アトリビュートの MObject。"
msgstr "MObject attribute."

msgid "MPlug を受け取って値を返す関数。bool/int/float 系の数値アトリビュート、     角度・距離・時間の単位アトリビュート、enum、文字列、doubleArray/Int32Array/     stringArray/vectorArray/pointArray/matrixArrayが対象。それ以外は     ``_CMDS_READER``。この場合は呼出元がgeneric行列の判定やcmdsへの読取委譲を行う。"
msgstr "A function that takes an MPlug and returns its value. Supports bool/int/float numeric attributes, angle/distance/time unit attributes, enums, strings, and doubleArray/Int32Array/stringArray/vectorArray/pointArray/matrixArray. Returns ``_CMDS_READER`` otherwise; the caller then detects generic matrix values or delegates reading to cmds."

msgid "MPlug を受け取って値を返す関数。bool/int/float 系の数値アトリビュート、"
msgstr "Function that takes an MPlug and returns a value. Numeric attributes of type bool/int/float,"

msgid "角度・距離・時間の単位アトリビュート、enum、文字列、doubleArray/Int32Array/ stringArray/vectorArray/pointArray/matrixArrayが対象。それ以外は ``_CMDS_READER``。この場合は呼出元がgeneric行列の判定やcmdsへの読取委譲を行う。"
msgstr "Supports angle/distance/time unit attributes, enums, strings, and doubleArray/Int32Array/stringArray/vectorArray/pointArray/matrixArray. Returns ``_CMDS_READER`` otherwise; the caller then detects generic matrix values or delegates reading to cmds."

msgid "mlib.core.extensions"
msgstr ""

msgid "Python探索パス直下のmlib_*拡張を検出する。独自Mayaプラグインはロードしない。"
msgstr "Detects mlib_* extensions under the Python path. Does not load custom Maya plug-ins."

msgid ":py:obj:`getDiagnostics <mlib.core.extensions.getDiagnostics>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "初期化結果と現在の依存可用性を分けて照会する。"
msgstr "Query initialization results and current dependency availability separately."

msgid ":py:obj:`status <mlib.core.extensions.status>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "最後の初期化で得た拡張名ごとの状態と理由をコピーして返す。"
msgstr "Return a copy of each extension's state and reason from the last initialization."

msgid "既に読み込まれた宣言のis_availableだけを呼ぶ。拡張の新規import、 型登録、reload、Mayaプラグインのロードは行わない。可用性の照会自体は Python依存を遅延importする場合があるが、シーン・UIを変更してはならない。"
msgstr "Only call is_available on declarations that are already imported. Do not import extensions, register types, reload modules, or load Maya plug-ins. Availability queries may lazily import Python dependencies, but must not change the scene or UI."

msgid "拡張名ごとのinitialization、available、reason。     initializationはstatusと同じ状態のコピーで、未初期化ならNone。     availableは現在の可用性を示すbool。未読込・初期化中・照会失敗はNoneで、     reasonに理由を保持する。初期化結果と登録表は変更しない。"
msgstr "initialization, available, and reason for each extension name. initialization is a copy of the same state as status, or None if initialization has not occurred. available is a bool indicating current availability. It is None if the extension is not loaded, is initializing, or the query fails; reason retains the explanation. Initialization results and registration tables remain unchanged."

msgid "拡張名ごとのinitialization、available、reason。"
msgstr "initialization, available, and reason for each extension."

msgid "initializationはstatusと同じ状態のコピーで、未初期化ならNone。 availableは現在の可用性を示すbool。未読込・初期化中・照会失敗はNoneで、 reasonに理由を保持する。初期化結果と登録表は変更しない。"
msgstr "initialization copies the status entry, or is None if initialization has not occurred. available is a bool for current availability; it is None for declarations not imported, initialization in progress, or query failures, with an explanation in reason. Initialization results and registries are unchanged."

msgid "現在の依存可用性は再照会しない。診断だけを更新する場合はgetDiagnosticsを使う。"
msgstr "Does not re-query current dependency availability. Use getDiagnostics to update diagnostics only."

msgid "拡張名ごとの状態と理由をコピーして返す。"
msgstr "Copy and return the status and reason for each file extension."

msgid "mlib.core.fastWrite"
msgstr ""

msgid "対応する値更新のcmds/OpenMayaバックエンド。独自プラグインは使わない。"
msgstr "Corresponding value update for cmds/OpenMaya backend. Do not use custom plug-ins."

msgid ":py:obj:`_TYPED_DATA_FACTORIES <mlib.core.fastWrite._TYPED_DATA_FACTORIES>`\\"
msgstr ":py:obj:`_TYPED_DATA_FACTORIES <mlib.core.fastWrite._TYPED_DATA_FACTORIES>`\\"

msgid ":py:obj:`_prepared_writes <mlib.core.fastWrite._prepared_writes>`\\ \\(plug\\, value\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "全成分の型・制限を更新前に検査し、直接書込みの列を組み立てる。"
msgstr "Validate all component types and restrictions before updating, then build a sequence of direct writes."

msgid ":py:obj:`_require_supported_type <mlib.core.fastWrite._require_supported_type>`\\ \\(plug\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`_require_supported_type <mlib.core.fastWrite._require_supported_type>`\\ \\(plug\\)"

msgid "fastで書ける型か全子の定義から確認する。値や書込み可否は検査しない。"
msgstr "Check every child definition for fast type support without validating values or writability."

msgid ":py:obj:`check_range <mlib.core.fastWrite.check_range>`\\ \\(plug\\, value\\[\\, \\_fn\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "cmds.setAttrと同様、アトリビュートに設定されたハード範囲を検査する。"
msgstr "Similar to ``cmds.setAttr``, this checks the hard range set on an attribute."

msgid ":py:obj:`prepare_data <mlib.core.fastWrite.prepare_data>`\\ \\(attribute\\, value\\, \\*\\[\\, name\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "MPlugを必要とせず、行列・typed dataの型と値を検査する。"
msgstr "Validate matrix and typed-data types and values without requiring an MPlug."

msgid ":py:obj:`set_attr <mlib.core.fastWrite.set_attr>`\\ \\(name\\, \\*values\\[\\, fast\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "既存のsetAttrと同じ値入力を、明示fast時だけMPlugへ渡す。"
msgstr "For existing setAttr inputs with the same value, pass them explicitly to MPlug only in fast mode."

msgid ":py:obj:`set_plug <mlib.core.fastWrite.set_plug>`\\ \\(plug\\, value\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "全成分を事前検証してMPlugへ設定する。Undoには記録しない。"
msgstr "Validate all components in advance and set the MPlug without recording Undo."

msgid ":py:obj:`writable <mlib.core.fastWrite.writable>`\\ \\(plug\\[\\, \\_fn\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "ロック・入力接続・書込み不能アトリビュートをAPIで検査する。"
msgstr "Check locked input connections and write-protected attributes using the API."

msgid "書込み先。"
msgstr "Write destination."

msgid "内部単位の入力値。"
msgstr "Input value in internal units."

msgid "setter・プラグ・変換済み値・書込み終了まで保持するfunction setの列。"
msgstr "Sequence of setter, plug, converted value, and function set retained until writing finishes."

msgid "API 2.0で値を構築できない型の場合。"
msgstr "When API 2.0 cannot construct a value of this type."

msgid "safeの部分更新前に呼び、ロックや不正な値によって後続の未対応型が隠れるのを防ぐ。 対応するtyped配列の型表は、実データを構築するprepare_dataと共有する。"
msgstr "Called before safe partial updates so locks or invalid values cannot hide a later unsupported type. Shares the supported typed-array table with prepare_data, which constructs the actual data."

msgid "有効性を確認済みの更新対象。"
msgstr "The update target whose validity has already been checked."

msgid "子を含め、fastで扱えない型がある場合。"
msgstr "The target or one of its children has a type that fast does not support."

msgid "検査するプラグ。"
msgstr "Plug to check."

msgid "設定予定の値。単位型ではcm/rad/秒。"
msgstr "Configured value. For unit types, cm/rad/sec."

msgid "同じ更新内で 生成したfunction set。範囲と単位定義は呼出しごとに照会する。"
msgstr "Function sets created within the same update. Range and unit definitions are queried for each invocation."

msgid "値が設定されたハード範囲外の場合。"
msgstr "When the value is set outside the hard range."

msgid "登録前でもよいアトリビュート定義。"
msgstr "Attribute definition, which may be unregistered."

msgid "設定予定の値。"
msgstr "Values planned for application."

msgid "エラー表示用の名前。"
msgstr "Name used in error messages."

msgid "setter、変換済み値、書込み終了まで保持するfunction set。"
msgstr "Setter, converted value, and function set retained until writing completes."

msgid "アトリビュート名。"
msgstr "Attribute name."

msgid "cmds.setAttr と同じ形・現在の Maya 単位の値。"
msgstr "Same format as cmds.setAttr and values in the current Maya unit."

msgid "TrueはOpenMaya直接更新。呼出元が明示的に指定する。"
msgstr "True updates directly through OpenMaya. The caller must pass this explicitly."

msgid "setAttr のフラグ。fast 時の対応フラグは限定される。"
msgstr "``setAttr`` flag. The flags for fast mode have limited support."

msgid "型・書込み可否・ハード範囲を確認し、型付きデータを構築してから準備順に書き込む。 function setはデータの受渡しが終わるまで保持する。Undo設定は変更しない。 事前検証後のAPI書込みで失敗した場合、先に書いた成分の自動復元は行わない。"
msgstr "Checks types, writability, and hard limits, constructs typed data, then writes in preparation order. Retains function sets until data transfer finishes. Does not change the Undo setting. If an API write fails after preparation, earlier component writes are not automatically restored."

msgid "更新対象。"
msgstr "Update target."

msgid "角度rad、距離cm、時間秒の値。"
msgstr "Values in radians, centimeters, and seconds."

msgid "API 2.0で未対応の型の場合。更新前に拒否する。"
msgstr "When API 2.0 does not support the type. Rejected before updating."

msgid "同じ更新内で生成したアトリビュートの function set。省略時は新しく生成する。値や検査結果はキャッシュしない。"
msgstr "Function set of attributes generated within the same update. If omitted, new ones are generated. Values and inspection results are not cached."

msgid "ロック・入力接続・書込み禁止がある場合。"
msgstr "When the input connection is locked, or writing is prohibited."

msgid "mlib.core.geometryEdit"
msgstr ""

msgid "形状座標の照会と通常/fast更新。通常はcmds、fastは履歴なし形状へ直接書く。"
msgstr "Querying shape coordinates and normal/fast updates. Normal mode writes via cmds, fast mode writes directly to shapes without history."

msgid ":py:obj:`_set_positions_direct <mlib.core.geometryEdit._set_positions_direct>`\\ \\(shape\\, indices\\, values\\[\\, ws\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "検証済みのcm座標を一括設定する。CVのwは変更しない。"
msgstr "Set cm coordinates verified by batch. Do not change CV w."

msgid ":py:obj:`command_indices <mlib.core.geometryEdit.command_indices>`\\ \\(shape\\, indices\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "検証済みのAPI番号をcmds用番号へ写す。順序と重複は維持する。"
msgstr "Map verified API numbers to cmds numbers, maintaining order and duplicates."

msgid ":py:obj:`geometry <mlib.core.geometryEdit.geometry>`\\ \\(shape\\, indices\\[\\, edit\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Shapeの保持DAGパスと関数セットを取得し、必要なら直接編集の前提を検査する。"
msgstr "Get the Shape's retained DAG path and function set, optionally checking prerequisites for direct editing."

msgid ":py:obj:`object_positions <mlib.core.geometryEdit.object_positions>`\\ \\(shape\\, indices\\, values\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "APIのワールド座標を、CVの重みを保持したローカルXYZへ変換する。"
msgstr "Convert world space coordinates from the API to local XYZ coordinates while preserving CV weights."

msgid ":py:obj:`positions <mlib.core.geometryEdit.positions>`\\ \\(shape\\, indices\\[\\, ws\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "指定した点を保持順・cm単位で取得する。"
msgstr "Get the specified point in preserve order and cm units."

msgid ":py:obj:`setPositions <mlib.core.geometryEdit.setPositions>`\\ \\(shape\\, indices\\, values\\[\\, ws\\, fast\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "検証済みのcm座標を書き込む。Undo範囲は呼出元が管理する。"
msgstr "Write verified cm coordinates. Undo scope is managed by the caller."

msgid ":py:obj:`set_uvs <mlib.core.geometryEdit.set_uvs>`\\ \\(shape\\, indices\\, values\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "現在のUV配列を読み、指定番号のU/Vを置換してOpenMayaへ一括設定する。"
msgstr "Read the current UV arrays, replace U/V values at the specified indices, and write the arrays together through OpenMaya."

msgid "履歴なしMeshまたは非周期NurbsCurve。"
msgstr "Mesh without history or non-periodic NurbsCurve."

msgid "検証済みの番号。"
msgstr "Verified number."

msgid "設定するXYZ。"
msgstr "Set XYZ."

msgid "TrueならAPIワールド座標、Falseならローカル座標。"
msgstr "True for API world coordinates, False for local coordinates."

msgid "MeshまたはNurbsCurve。"
msgstr "Mesh or NurbsCurve."

msgid "APIの番号。"
msgstr "API number."

msgid "周期カーブでは末尾の重複CVを先頭の独立CVへ写した番号。"
msgstr "For periodic curves, the number of duplicated CVs at the end that are mapped to the initial independent CVs."

msgid "呼出し側がShape型と番号範囲を検証済みであることを前提とする。edit=Trueでは 周期カーブ、inMesh/createへの入力、Shapeノードのロックを検査する。 指定点のpnts/controlPointsとその子についても、上位を含むロック・入力接続と、各対象アトリビュートの書込み可否を調べる。 indicesが空のUV更新では、点Plugごとの検査は行わない。"
msgstr "Assumes the caller has validated the Shape type and index bounds. With edit=True, checks for periodic curves, inputs to inMesh/create, and the Shape node lock. For each specified point's pnts/controlPoints Plug and its children, also checks locks and input connections including ancestors, and each target attribute's writability. UV updates with empty indices do not perform per-point Plug checks."

msgid "型を解決済みのShapeラッパー。"
msgstr "A Shape wrapper whose type has already been resolved."

msgid "範囲検証済みのAPI点番号。UV番号ではない。"
msgstr "API point indices whose bounds have been validated. These are not UV indices."

msgid "Trueで直接編集の制限を検査する。Falseは照会用。"
msgstr "True checks direct-edit restrictions. False is for queries."

msgid "保持DAGパス、MFnMeshまたはMFnNurbsCurve、MeshならTrue。     関数セットの取得自体では座標を書き換えない。"
msgstr "The retained DAG path, MFnMesh or MFnNurbsCurve, and True for a Mesh.     Obtaining the function set itself does not modify coordinates."

msgid "保持DAGパス、MFnMeshまたはMFnNurbsCurve、MeshならTrue。"
msgstr "The retained DAG path, MFnMesh or MFnNurbsCurve, and True for a Mesh."

msgid "関数セットの取得自体では座標を書き換えない。"
msgstr "Obtaining the function set itself does not modify coordinates."

msgid "edit=Trueで周期カーブまたはinMesh/create入力がある場合。"
msgstr "If edit=True and the curve is periodic or an inMesh/create input exists."

msgid "直接編集時のロック・入力接続・書込み禁止、またはShapeを参照できない場合。"
msgstr "If direct editing encounters a lock, input connection, or non-writable attribute, or the Shape cannot be accessed."

msgid "APIのワールドXYZ。距離はcm。"
msgstr "World XYZ of the API. Distance is in cm."

msgid "cmdsのobjectSpaceへ渡すcmの座標。"
msgstr "Coordinate in object space to pass to cm via cmds."

msgid "ワールド行列が特異な場合。"
msgstr "World matrix is singular."

msgid "有効なMeshまたはNurbsCurve。"
msgstr "Valid Mesh or NurbsCurve."

msgid "検証済みの点番号。"
msgstr "Verified vertex index."

msgid "Trueならワールド空間へ変換する。"
msgstr "If true, convert to world space."

msgid "指定順の座標。単点では全点を取得しない。"
msgstr "Coordinates in specified order. A single point does not retrieve all points."

msgid "検証済みのAPI番号。重複は後の値を優先。"
msgstr "Verified API number. Duplicates are resolved by giving priority to later values."

msgid "番号と同数の有限なXYZ。"
msgstr "Finite XYZ rows, one per index."

msgid "Trueならワールド座標。"
msgstr "True then world coordinates."

msgid "TrueはOpenMaya直接更新。通常はcmds.xformを使う。"
msgstr "True updates directly through OpenMaya. The normal path uses cmds.xform."

msgid "fastで未対応の形状の場合。"
msgstr "For shapes that are not supported in fast mode."

msgid "Mayaが書込みを拒否した場合。完了済みの変更は戻さない。"
msgstr "If Maya refuses a write. Completed changes are not restored automatically."

msgid "空の番号列はMayaへ問い合わせず戻る。非空なら入力履歴とShapeノードのロックを検査するが、 個々のUV-set Plugの書込み可否は検査しない。UV割当てやセットは作成しない。 Undoへ記録せず、Undo設定も変更しない。呼出し側が座標・件数・番号範囲を検証する。"
msgstr "An empty index sequence returns without querying Maya. Otherwise, checks input history and the Shape node lock, but not the writability of individual UV-set Plugs. Does not create UV assignments or sets. Neither records Undo nor changes the Undo setting. The caller validates coordinates, counts, and index bounds."

msgid "対象Mesh。"
msgstr "The target Mesh."

msgid "検証済みのUV番号。"
msgstr "Validated UV indices."

msgid "indicesに対応する無次元の(U, V)行。"
msgstr "Dimensionless (U, V) rows corresponding to indices."

msgid "inMeshへの入力がある場合。"
msgstr "If an inMesh input exists."

msgid "Shapeがロックされている、またはMayaの読取り・設定・更新に失敗した場合。"
msgstr "If the Shape is locked, or Maya fails to read, set, or update the data."

msgid "指定外の番号は読み出した値を保持する。setUVs後にupdateSurfaceを呼び、 後段の失敗時に自動で元の配列へ戻す処理は持たない。"
msgstr "Unspecified indices retain their values from the read arrays. Calls updateSurface after setUVs and does not automatically restore the original arrays if a later step fails."

msgid "mlib.core"
msgstr ""

msgid "mlibの型登録・初期化・再読み込み機能を公開する。"
msgstr "Expose mlib type registration, initialization, and reloading utilities."

msgid "mlib.core.jointEdit"
msgstr ""

msgid "Jointの再親付けを、回転チャンネルとSSCを保って直接実行する。"
msgstr "Reparent a Joint directly while preserving its rotation channels and SSC."

msgid ":py:obj:`reparent <mlib.core.jointEdit.reparent>`\\ \\(plan\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "検証済みJointを移動し、inverseScale接続と姿勢を復元する。"
msgstr "Move a validated Joint and restore its inverseScale connection and pose."

msgid ":py:obj:`reparent_plan <mlib.core.jointEdit.reparent_plan>`\\ \\(joint\\, parent\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "cmds.parentで中間Transformを必要としないJointの更新計画を作る。"
msgstr "Build an update plan for a Joint that does not require an intermediate Transform with cmds.parent."

msgid "reparent_planが返した計画。"
msgstr "Plan returned by reparent_plan."

msgid "移動するJoint。"
msgstr "Joint to move."

msgid "移動先。"
msgstr "Destination parent."

msgid "対象、親、移動・jointOrient、新しいinverseScale入力。"
msgstr "Target, parent, translation, jointOrient, and new inverseScale input."

msgid "mlib.core.nodeEdit"
msgstr ""

msgid "Undoへ登録しないノード作成・改名・削除のOpenMaya実装。"
msgstr "OpenMaya implementations of node creation, renaming, and deletion without recording Undo."

msgid ":py:obj:`create_node <mlib.core.nodeEdit.create_node>`\\ \\(node\\_type\\, flags\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "Mayaの代表的なcreateNodeフラグをOpenMayaで実行する。"
msgstr "Implement common Maya createNode flags with OpenMaya."

msgid ":py:obj:`delete_node <mlib.core.nodeEdit.delete_node>`\\ \\(node\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "DAGメンバーを持つDGコンテナも扱えるmodifierでノードを削除する。"
msgstr "Delete a node using a modifier that also supports DG containers with DAG members."

msgid ":py:obj:`rename_node <mlib.core.nodeEdit.rename_node>`\\ \\(node\\, name\\[\\, ignore\\_shape\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "ノードと、旧名の接頭辞が一致する直属Shapeを改名する。"
msgstr "Rename a node and its direct shapes whose names share the old prefix."

msgid ":py:obj:`require_editable <mlib.core.nodeEdit.require_editable>`\\ \\(node\\[\\, descendants\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "構造変更前に参照・ロックされたノードを拒否する。"
msgstr "Reject referenced or locked nodes before structural changes."

msgid ":py:obj:`validate_deletion <mlib.core.nodeEdit.validate_deletion>`\\ \\(nodes\\[\\, safe\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "混在した削除対象を更新前に検査し、後続の失敗による部分削除を避ける。"
msgstr "Validate mixed deletion targets before updates to prevent partial deletion caused by later failures."

msgid "作成するnodeType。"
msgstr "nodeType to create."

msgid "正規化済みname/parent/skipSelect/shared。"
msgstr "Normalized name/parent/skipSelect/shared flags."

msgid "作成したノード。Shapeの暗黙の親ではなくShapeを返す。"
msgstr "Created node. Returns the Shape rather than its implicit parent."

msgid "削除するノード。削除後のMPlugを保持しないこと。"
msgstr "Node to delete. Do not retain MPlugs after deletion."

msgid "改名対象。"
msgstr "Node to rename."

msgid "Mayaが補正する新しい名前。"
msgstr "New name, subject to Maya's adjustments."

msgid "直属Shapeの連動改名を行わないか。"
msgstr "Whether to skip renaming direct shapes together with the node."

msgid "Mayaが確定したノード名。"
msgstr "Final node name assigned by Maya."

msgid "対象ノード。"
msgstr "Target node."

msgid "DAG子孫も検査するか。"
msgstr "Whether to also check DAG descendants."

msgid "呼出し順の削除対象。"
msgstr "Deletion targets in call order."

msgid "接続を持つ対象を残すか。"
msgstr "Whether to retain targets with connections."

msgid "class mlib.core.object.Object"
msgstr ""

msgid "Mayaのノード・プラグ・単一コンポーネントへの参照を共通の入口で取得する。"
msgstr "Retrieve a reference to a Maya node, plug, or single component through a common entry point."

msgid "``Object(value)`` は入力をNode・Plug・単数Componentへ振り分ける。 プラグやコンポーネントを所有ノードへ変換する入口ではない。 ノード作成・複製・選択変更は行わず、複数対象や複数要素のコンポーネント範囲は受け付けない。"
msgstr "``Object(value)`` resolves its input to a Node, Plug, or single Component. It does not convert plugs or components to their owning nodes. It does not create or duplicate nodes or change the selection, and rejects multiple targets and component ranges containing multiple elements."

msgid "既存ラッパーを渡した場合は、削除済みでも有効性を再検査せず同じインスタンスを返す。 対象の有効性・等価比較・ハッシュは各参照型が担当する。 コレクションや数学値はこの基底に含めない。"
msgstr "An existing wrapper is returned as the same instance without rechecking validity, even if its target has been deleted. Each reference type handles validity, equality, and hashing. Collections and mathematical values do not derive from this base."

msgid ":py:obj:`_classes <mlib.core.object.Object._classes>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "循環 import を避けるため、判定に使う mlib クラスを呼び出し時に取得する。"
msgstr "To avoid circular imports, obtain the mlib class used for checks at call time."

msgid ":py:obj:`_flatten_inputs <mlib.core.object.Object._flatten_inputs>`\\ \\(values\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "対象列を一度だけ展開する。型別の混在規則は呼出し側が検証する。"
msgstr "Expand the target column only once. The mixed type rules are validated by the caller."

msgid ":py:obj:`_input_name <mlib.core.object.Object._input_name>`\\ \\(value\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "単一の対象を maya.cmds へ渡せる一意な名前へ変換する。"
msgstr "Convert to a unique name that can be passed to maya.cmds for a single target."

msgid ":py:obj:`_input_names <mlib.core.object.Object._input_names>`\\ \\(values\\[\\, allow\\_plugs\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "単一の対象・コレクション・反復可能オブジェクトを名前のリストへ正規化する。"
msgstr "Normalize a single target, collection, or iterable object to a list of names."

msgid ":py:obj:`_name <mlib.core.object.Object._name>`\\ \\(value\\, node\\_class\\, plug\\_class\\, component\\_class\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "単一の対象を名前へ変換する(Object._input_name の本体)。"
msgstr "Converts a single target to a name (the body of Object._input_name)."

msgid ":py:obj:`_resolve_input <mlib.core.object.Object._resolve_input>`\\ \\(value\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "名前またはMaya API参照から、種類に対応する単数ラッパーを取得する。"
msgstr "Retrieve the appropriate single-target wrapper from a name or Maya API reference."

msgid ":py:obj:`_unsupported <mlib.core.object.Object._unsupported>`\\ \\(value\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "対応しない入力型の TypeError を作る。"
msgstr "Create a TypeError for unsupported input types."

msgid ":py:obj:`asString <mlib.core.object.Object.asString>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "現在の対象名を文字列へ変換する。"
msgstr "Convert the current target name to a string."

msgid "Node、Plug、Component、Components。"
msgstr "Node、Plug、Component、Components。"

msgid "単数参照または入れ子の反復可能な対象列。"
msgstr "Single reference or nested iterable target sequence."

msgid "順序を保持した対象。Componentsは範囲圧縮のため展開しない。"
msgstr "Ordered set of targets. Components are not expanded for range compression."

msgid "未対応型の場合。"
msgstr "In the case of unsupported types."

msgid "文字列は解決せず(Maya へ問い合わせず)そのまま返す。解決済みの Node が 必要な場合は Node._resolve_input を使う。変換規則はモジュールの説明を参照。"
msgstr "Strings are returned as-is without resolution (without querying Maya). If a resolved Node is needed, use Node._resolve_input. Refer to the module's description for the conversion rules."

msgid "変換対象。"
msgstr "Target for conversion."

msgid "maya.cmds で解決できる名前。"
msgstr "Names that can be resolved with maya.cmds."

msgid "対応しない型、依存ノード以外を指す MObject、または Components などの複数の対象を渡した場合(Object._input_names を使う)。"
msgstr "When passing MObject that does not point to unsupported types or dependency nodes, or multiple targets such as components (using Object._input_names)."

msgid "空文字列、または無効な(削除済み・範囲外の)対象の場合。"
msgstr "Empty string, or invalid (deleted or out-of-range) target."

msgid "単一の対象(Object._input_name が受け付ける型)は1要素のリストになる。``Components``・ ``Selection``・``Joints`` などのコレクションと、list/tuple/set/ジェネレーター などの反復可能オブジェクトは、入れ子も含めて保持順に展開する。 ``ArrayPlug`` は要素へ展開せず、配列アトリビュートそのものの名前として扱う。 ``Components`` は全番号をまとめて1回だけ検証し、保持順で連続する番号を ``|cube|cubeShape.vtx[0:9]`` のような範囲指定の名前にまとめる(要素数が多くても maya.cmds へ渡す名前が増えない)。"
msgstr "A single target (the type accepted by Object._input_name) will be a list with a single element. Collections such as ``Components``, ``Selection``, ``Joints`` and iterable objects such as list/tuple/set/generators will be expanded in order, including nested structures. ``ArrayPlug`` will not be expanded into elements, but treated as the name of the array attribute itself. ``Components`` will validate all numbers at once only once, and group consecutive numbers in order into range-style names like ``|cube|cubeShape.vtx[0:9]``, so even if there are many elements, the number of names passed to maya.cmds does not increase."

msgid "変換対象。単一の対象、または対象を要素に持つ反復可能オブジェクト。"
msgstr "Target for conversion. A single target or an iterable object containing targets."

msgid "False の場合、Plug(``ArrayPlug`` を含む)と ``om2.MPlug`` を TypeError にする(アトリビュートを渡しても maya.cmds が何もしないコマンド用。文字列は 解決しないため対象外)。"
msgstr "If false, make Plug(``ArrayPlug`` including) and ``om2.MPlug`` a TypeError (for attributes passed to commands that do nothing in maya.cmds. Strings are excluded as they are not resolved)."

msgid "正規化した名前のリスト。空の反復可能オブジェクトは空リスト。"
msgstr "List of normalized names. An empty iterable object is an empty list."

msgid "いずれかの要素が対応しない型の場合。allow_plugs が False で、 Plug・MPlug が含まれる場合。同じ対象列に文字列とNodeが混在する場合。"
msgstr "When any element has a mismatched type. When allow_plugs is False and Plug or MPlug is included. When strings and nodes are mixed in the same target column."

