msgid ":py:obj:`__imul__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__imul__>`\\ \\(other\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__imul__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__imul__>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "自身へ右から MQuaternion 系を掛ける(``self = self * other``)。"
msgstr "Multiply itself by MQuaternion from the right side (``self = self * other``)."

msgid ":py:obj:`__init__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__init__>`\\ \\(\\*args\\, \\*\\*kwargs\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__init__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__init__>`\\ \\(\\*args\\, \\*\\*kwargs\\)"

msgid "成分を設定する。"
msgstr "Set the components."

msgid ":py:obj:`__isub__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__isub__>`\\ \\(other\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__isub__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__isub__>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "MQuaternion 系を成分ごとに自身から減算する(om2 の MQuaternion には無い in-place 版)。"
msgstr "Subtracts from itself component-wise to the MQuaternion system (in-place version not available in om2's MQuaternion)."

msgid ":py:obj:`__iter__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__iter__>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__iter__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__iter__>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "X、Y、Z、W の順に成分を反復する。"
msgstr "Iterate through the components in the order of X, Y, Z, W."

msgid ":py:obj:`__mul__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__mul__>`\\ \\(other\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__mul__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__mul__>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "om2 の順序で四元数の積を返す(自身を先に適用する回転)。"
msgstr "Returns the quaternion product in om2 order (rotations are applied with self first)."

msgid ":py:obj:`__ne__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__ne__>`\\ \\(other\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__ne__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__ne__>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid ":py:obj:`__neg__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__neg__>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__neg__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__neg__>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "全成分の符号を反転した四元数を返す(同じ回転を表す)。"
msgstr "Returns a quaternion with inverted components (representing the same rotation)."

msgid ":py:obj:`__new__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__new__>`\\ \\(\\*args\\, \\*\\*kwargs\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__new__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__new__>`\\ \\(\\*args\\, \\*\\*kwargs\\)"

msgid "C++ の実体を確保した cls のインスタンス(単位四元数)を作る。"
msgstr "Create an instance of the cls that has allocated C++ memory (unit quaternion)."

msgid ":py:obj:`__radd__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__radd__>`\\ \\(other\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__radd__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__radd__>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "左辺の MQuaternion 系との成分ごとの和を返す。"
msgstr "Returns the component-wise sum with the left-hand side MQuaternion type."

msgid ":py:obj:`__reduce__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__reduce__>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__reduce__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__reduce__>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid ":py:obj:`__reduce_ex__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__reduce_ex__>`\\ \\(protocol\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__reduce_ex__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__reduce_ex__>`\\ \\(protocol\\)"

msgid ":py:obj:`__repr__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__repr__>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__repr__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__repr__>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "クラス名と4成分を含むデバッグ表現を返す。"
msgstr "Returns a debug representation containing the class name and four components."

msgid ":py:obj:`__rmul__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__rmul__>`\\ \\(other\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__rmul__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__rmul__>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "左辺の MQuaternion 系との積を om2 の順序で返す。数値なら成分をスケールする。"
msgstr "Returns the product with the MQuaternion on the left side in the order of om2. If it is a number, scales the components."

msgid ":py:obj:`__rsub__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__rsub__>`\\ \\(other\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__rsub__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__rsub__>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "左辺の MQuaternion 系から自身を引いた成分ごとの差を返す。"
msgstr "Returns the component-wise difference between self and the left-hand side MQuaternion system."

msgid ":py:obj:`__setitem__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__setitem__>`\\ \\(index\\, value\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__setitem__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__setitem__>`\\ \\(index\\, value\\)"

msgid ":py:obj:`__sub__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__sub__>`\\ \\(other\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`__sub__ <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.__sub__>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "成分ごとの差を返す(om2 の ``-``)。"
msgstr "Returns the difference per component (of om2 ``-``)."

msgid ":py:obj:`_wrap <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion._wrap>`\\ \\(value\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`_wrap <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion._wrap>`\\ \\(value\\)"

msgid ":py:obj:`angleTo <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.angleTo>`\\ \\(other\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`angleTo <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.angleTo>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "別の四元数が表す回転との角度差をラジアンで返す。"
msgstr "Returns the angle difference in radians between this quaternion and another quaternion."

msgid ":py:obj:`asAxisAngle <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asAxisAngle>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`asAxisAngle <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asAxisAngle>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "OpenMayaの軸角表現をmlibの軸ベクトルで返す。"
msgstr "Returns OpenMaya's axis-angle representation with an mlib axis vector."

msgid ":py:obj:`asCanonicalAxisAngle <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asCanonicalAxisAngle>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`asCanonicalAxisAngle <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asCanonicalAxisAngle>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "軸と角度の組へ分解する。"
msgstr "Decompose into axis-angle pairs."

msgid ":py:obj:`asDecomposedEulerRotate <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asDecomposedEulerRotate>`\\ \\(\\[order\\]\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`asDecomposedEulerRotate <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asDecomposedEulerRotate>`\\ \\(\\[order\\]\\)"

msgid "EulerRotate へ変換する。"
msgstr "Convert to EulerRotate."

msgid ":py:obj:`asEulerRotate <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asEulerRotate>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`asEulerRotate <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asEulerRotate>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"

msgid "標準のasEulerRotationへ委譲し、EulerRotateの新しい値を返す。"
msgstr "Delegate to the standard asEulerRotation method and return a new EulerRotate value."

msgid ":py:obj:`asEulerRotation <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asEulerRotation>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`asEulerRotation <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asEulerRotation>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"

msgid "保持する回転を、等価なEulerRotateへ変換する。"
msgstr "Convert the stored rotation to an equivalent EulerRotate."

msgid ":py:obj:`asMatrix <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asMatrix>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`asMatrix <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asMatrix>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"

msgid "保持する回転を、等価な回転行列へ変換する。"
msgstr "Convert the stored rotation to an equivalent rotation matrix."

msgid ":py:obj:`asSwingTwist <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asSwingTwist>`\\ \\(\\[axis\\]\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`asSwingTwist <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asSwingTwist>`\\ \\(\\[axis\\]\\)"

msgid "指定軸まわりの捻り(twist)と、それ以外の曲げ(swing)へ分解する。"
msgstr "Decompose into twist around the specified axis and swing for the remaining degrees of freedom."

msgid ":py:obj:`asUnitMatrix <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asUnitMatrix>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`asUnitMatrix <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.asUnitMatrix>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "Quaternionの正規化したコピーから、独立した回転Matrixを作る。"
msgstr "Create an independent rotation Matrix from a normalized copy of the Quaternion."

msgid ":py:obj:`conjugate <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.conjugate>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`conjugate <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.conjugate>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "共役四元数を返す(om2 の同名メソッドを mlib の型で返すよう上書き)。"
msgstr "Returns the conjugate quaternion (overrides the same method in om2 to return the result with mlib types)."

msgid ":py:obj:`dot <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.dot>`\\ \\(other\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`dot <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.dot>`\\ \\(other\\)"

msgid "4成分の内積を返す。"
msgstr "Returns the dot product of two 4-component vectors."

msgid ":py:obj:`exp <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.exp>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`exp <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.exp>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"

msgid "四元数の指数を、新しいQuaternionとして返す。"
msgstr "Return the quaternion exponential as a new Quaternion."

msgid ":py:obj:`fromAxisAngle <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.fromAxisAngle>`\\ \\(axis\\, angle\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`fromAxisAngle <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.fromAxisAngle>`\\ \\(axis\\, angle\\)"

msgid "軸と角度から回転四元数を生成する。"
msgstr "Generate rotation quaternion from axis and angle."

msgid ":py:obj:`inverse <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.inverse>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`inverse <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.inverse>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "逆四元数(共役を長さの2乗で割った値)を返す。"
msgstr "Returns the inverse quaternion (the value divided by the square of its length)."

msgid ":py:obj:`length <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.length>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`length <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.length>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "四元数の長さ(ノルム)を返す。"
msgstr "Returns the length (norm) of a quaternion."

msgid ":py:obj:`log <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.log>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`log <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.log>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"

msgid "四元数の自然対数を、新しいQuaternionとして返す。"
msgstr "Return the quaternion's natural logarithm as a new Quaternion."

msgid ":py:obj:`mirror <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.mirror>`\\ \\(\\[axis\\]\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`mirror <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.mirror>`\\ \\(\\[axis\\]\\)"

msgid ":py:obj:`mirrorIt <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.mirrorIt>`\\ \\(\\[axis\\]\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`mirrorIt <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.mirrorIt>`\\ \\(\\[axis\\]\\)"

msgid ":py:obj:`normal <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.normal>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`normal <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.normal>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"

msgid "OpenMayaの規則で正規化したQuaternionの複製を返す。"
msgstr "Return a copy of the Quaternion normalized under OpenMaya's rules."

msgid ":py:obj:`rotateVector <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.rotateVector>`\\ \\(vector\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`rotateVector <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.rotateVector>`\\ \\(vector\\)"

msgid "Quaternionの正規化したコピーで、XYZベクトルを回転する。"
msgstr "Rotate an XYZ vector with a normalized copy of the Quaternion."

msgid ":py:obj:`slerp <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.slerp>`\\ \\(other\\, t\\[\\, spin\\]\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`slerp <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.slerp>`\\ \\(other\\, t\\[\\, spin\\]\\)"

msgid "別の四元数との球面線形補間を返す。"
msgstr "Returns spherical linear interpolation with another quaternion."

msgid ":py:obj:`squad <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.squad>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`squad <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.squad>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"

msgid "四元数空間の三次曲線上で補間したQuaternionを返す。"
msgstr "Return a Quaternion interpolated on a cubic curve in quaternion space."

msgid ":py:obj:`squadPt <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.squadPt>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`squadPt <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.squadPt>`\\ \\(\\*args\\)"

msgid "squadで滑らかにつながる曲線の中間制御回転を計算する。"
msgstr "Compute an intermediate control rotation for a smoothly connected squad curve."

msgid ":py:obj:`unit <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.unit>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`unit <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.unit>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "正規化した新しい四元数を返す。"
msgstr "Returns a normalized new quaternion."

msgid ":py:obj:`unitIt <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.unitIt>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`unitIt <mlib.maths.quaternion.Quaternion.unitIt>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "ゼロ値を拒否して自身を正規化する。"
msgstr "Normalizes self in place, rejecting a zero value."

msgid "MQuaternion 系。"
msgstr "MQuaternion family."

msgid "MQuaternion 系なら om2 と同じ比較の結果。 その他の om2 の型は False。それ以外の型は NotImplemented(相手の比較に委ね、 どちらも判断しなければ False になる)。"
msgstr "If the other operand is of type MQuaternion or similar, the comparison result is the same as with om2. For other types in om2, it returns False. For any other types, it returns NotImplemented (delegates the comparison to the other object; if neither can evaluate the comparison, it defaults to False)."

msgid "-4〜3 の添字(X、Y、Z、W の順)、またはスライス。"
msgstr "-4 to 3 indices (in the order X, Y, Z, W), or a slice."

msgid "指定成分。スライスでは成分の tuple。"
msgstr "Specified component. In slices, components are tuples."

msgid "右側の MQuaternion 系。"
msgstr "The MQuaternion family on the right side."

msgid "``()``、``(x, y, z, w)``、``(values)``、``(MQuaternion)``、 ``(angle, axis)``、``(a, b[, factor])`` など om2 の MQuaternion の コンストラクタが受け付ける引数。"
msgstr "Arguments that om2 MQuaternion constructors accept, such as ``()``, ``(x, y, z, w)``, ``(values)``, ``(MQuaternion)``, ``(angle, axis)``, ``(a, b[, factor])``."

msgid "``x``、``y``、``z``、``w``。位置引数と合わせて使える。 省略した成分は (0, 0, 0, 1) の値。"
msgstr "``x``, ``y``, ``z``, ``w``. Can be used with positional arguments. Omitted components have the value (0, 0, 0, 1)."

msgid "om2 のコンストラクタが受け付けない引数の場合。"
msgstr "When the argument is not accepted by the om2 constructor."

msgid "未知のキーワード引数、または同じ成分を二重に指定した場合。"
msgstr "When an unknown keyword argument is used, or when the same component is specified twice."

msgid "4成分のイテレータ。"
msgstr "4-component iterator."

msgid "積。正規化しない。対応しない型は NotImplemented。"
msgstr "Sum. Do not normalize. Return NotImplemented for unsupported types."

msgid "MQuaternion 系なら om2 と同じ比較の結果。 その他の om2 の型は True。それ以外の型は NotImplemented。"
msgstr "If the type is MQuaternion or similar, the comparison result is the same as om2. Other om2 types return True. Other types return NotImplemented."

msgid "新しい四元数。"
msgstr "New quaternion."

msgid "理由は :meth:`mlib.maths.vector.Vector.__new__` と同じ(``__new__`` だけで 作ったインスタンスがアクセス時に落ちないよう、ここで確保する)。"
msgstr "The reason is the same as :meth:`mlib.maths.vector.Vector.__new__` (to ensure that instances created only with ``__new__`` do not crash upon access, we allocate them here)."

msgid "cls の単位四元数。"
msgstr "Unit quaternion of cls."

msgid "``(_rebuild, (type(self), (x, y, z, w))[, state])``。 利用者の派生クラスの ``__init__`` は呼ばず、``__dict__`` と ``__slots__`` の アトリビュートは再構築時に復元する。"
msgstr "``(_rebuild, (type(self), (x, y, z, w))[, state])``. The user's derived class does not call ``__init__``, and the attributes ``__dict__`` and ``__slots__`` are restored upon reconstruction."

msgid "``Quaternion(x, y, z, w)`` の形式の文字列。"
msgstr "A string in the form of ``Quaternion(x, y, z, w)``."

msgid "``数値 * q`` は om2 と同じく4成分それぞれのスカラー倍(正規化しない)。 ``q * 数値`` は om2 と同じく対応しない。"
msgstr "``数値 * q`` is scalar multiplication of each of the four components, as in om2, but does not normalize. ``q * 数値`` does not correspond to om2, as in om2."

msgid "左側の MQuaternion 系、または int / float。"
msgstr "Left side: MQuaternion types, or int / float."

msgid "積。対応しない型は NotImplemented。"
msgstr "Sum. Types that do not match return NotImplemented."

msgid "-4〜3 の添字。"
msgstr "-4 to 3 index."

msgid "Python の ``__new__`` / ``__init__`` を通さない(利用者の派生クラスの ``__init__`` も呼ばない)。"
msgstr "Does not pass through Python's ``__new__`` / ``__init__`` (does not call the user's derived class ``__init__``)."

msgid "複製元。 ``setValue`` が受け付ける値。"
msgstr "Source of duplication. Values accepted by ``setValue``."

msgid "両方を正規化し、二重被覆(q と -q が同じ回転)を考慮する。acos を使わず ``4 * atan2(|p - q|, |p + q|)`` で計算するため、角度差が 0 や pi に近くても 精度を保つ。"
msgstr "Normalize both and take into account double coverage (q and -q represent the same rotation). Calculate using ``4 * atan2(|p - q|, |p + q|)`` without using acos, thus maintaining accuracy even when the angular difference is close to 0 or pi."

msgid "角度差を測る相手の回転。"
msgstr "The rotation of the object to measure the angle difference with."

msgid "0 から pi の範囲のラジアン角度。"
msgstr "Radians in the range from 0 to pi."

msgid "自身または other がゼロ四元数の場合。"
msgstr "When either self or other is a zero quaternion."

msgid "軸とラジアン角度。角度範囲はOpenMayaに従う。"
msgstr "The axis and angle in radians. The angle range follows OpenMaya."

msgid "om2 の ``asAxisAngle`` と異なり、w が負なら符号を反転して角度を 0 から pi の 範囲に収め、回転が無い場合の軸は (1, 0, 0) とする。角度は ``2 * atan2(|xyz|, w)`` で求めるため、微小な回転でも精度を保つ。"
msgstr "Unlike om2's ``asAxisAngle``, when w is negative, the sign is inverted and the angle is clamped to the range from 0 to pi, and the axis for zero rotation is (1, 0, 0). The angle is computed using ``2 * atan2(|xyz|, w)``, which ensures accuracy even for infinitesimally small rotations."

msgid "正規化した回転軸と、ラジアンの回転角度(0 から pi)。"
msgstr "Normalized rotation axis and rotation angle in radians (from 0 to pi)."

msgid "自身がゼロ四元数の場合。"
msgstr "When it is a zero quaternion."

msgid "正規化した回転行列を ``om2.MEulerRotation.decompose`` で分解するため、 ``Matrix.euler`` と同じ規約の角度になる。中間軸が 90 度を超える等価な角度を 返すことがある。"
msgstr "To decompose the normalized rotation matrix into ``om2.MEulerRotation.decompose``, the resulting angles will be in the same convention as ``Matrix.euler``. It may return equivalent angles where the intermediate axis exceeds 90 degrees."

msgid "回転順序。``\"xyz\"``/``\"yzx\"``/``\"zxy\"``/``\"xzy\"``/ ``\"yxz\"``/``\"zyx\"``、または om2 の番号 0〜5。"
msgstr "Rotation order. ``\"xyz\"``/``\"yzx\"``/``\"zxy\"``/``\"xzy\"``/ ``\"yxz\"``/``\"zyx\"``, or om2 numbers 0-5."

msgid "ラジアンの Euler 回転値。"
msgstr "Euler rotation values in radians."

msgid "order が未対応の場合、またはゼロ四元数の場合。"
msgstr "When the order is not supported, or when the quaternion is zero."

msgid "OpenMayaの標準メソッドへ渡す位置引数。"
msgstr "Positional arguments passed to the standard OpenMaya method."

msgid "ラジアンのEuler回転値。元の標準メソッドと同じ演算結果。"
msgstr "An Euler rotation in radians, with the same result as the original standard method."

msgid "OpenMaya標準のasEulerRotationも引き続き使用できる。 引数・例外・自身を変更しない動作は標準メソッドと同じ。"
msgstr "The OpenMaya-standard asEulerRotation method remains available. Arguments, exceptions, and the behavior that leaves the original value unchanged are the same as the standard method."

msgid "``twist`` は axis 周りだけの回転、``swing`` は axis の向きを変える残りの 回転。om2 の積の順序で ``twist * swing`` が自身と同じ回転になる (twist を先に適用し、続けて swing を適用する)。"
msgstr "``twist`` is the rotation around the axis, and ``swing`` is the remaining rotation that changes the direction of the axis. In om2, the product order ``twist * swing`` results in the same rotation as itself (apply twist first and then apply swing)."

msgid "捻り軸。内部で正規化する。"
msgstr "Twist axis. Normalizes internally."

msgid "(swing, twist)。どちらも正規化済み。"
msgstr "(swing, twist). Both are normalized."

msgid "axis がゼロベクトルの場合、または自身がゼロ四元数の場合。"
msgstr "When the axis is a zero vector, or when it is a zero quaternion."

msgid "自身を正規化する操作ではない。元のQuaternionやその成分参照は変更しない。 OpenMayaへそのまま委譲するasMatrix()とは別に、コピーの正規化とゼロ拒否を行う。"
msgstr "This does not normalize self. Do not change the original Quaternion or references to its components. Unlike asMatrix(), which delegates directly to OpenMaya, normalize a copy and reject zero."

msgid "回転だけを持つ新しい4行4列行列。追加Python状態は引き継がない。"
msgstr "A new 4x4 matrix containing only rotation. Do not preserve additional Python state."

msgid "自身がゼロQuaternionの場合。"
msgstr "If self is a zero Quaternion."

msgid "XYZ 成分の符号を反転した新しい四元数。"
msgstr "A new quaternion with inverted signs of the XYZ components."

msgid "内積の相手。x、y、z、w を持つ値。"
msgstr "Dot product operand. A value with x, y, z, and w components."

msgid "内積。"
msgstr "Dot product."

msgid "回転軸。内部で正規化する。"
msgstr "Rotation axis. Normalized internally."

msgid "回転角度(ラジアン)。"
msgstr "Rotation angle (radians)."

msgid "axis を中心に angle だけ回転する単位四元数。"
msgstr "Unit quaternion that rotates by angle around the axis."

