msgid "class mlib.maths.translate.Translate"
msgstr "class mlib.maths.translate.Translate"

msgid "位置・平行移動を表す意味付きの3成分ベクトル(om2.MVector の派生)。"
msgstr "A 3-component vector with semantic meaning representing position or translation (derived from om2.MVector)."

msgid "値・演算・比較はすべて :class:`~mlib.maths.vector.Vector` と同じ。 om2 の MVector を継承するため、``MFnTransform.setTranslation`` などへ そのまま渡せる。位置を行列で変換するときは :meth:`mlib.maths.matrix.Matrix.transformPoint` か ``om2.MPoint(t) * m`` を使う (``t * m`` は平行移動を含まない方向の変換になる)。"
msgstr "All values, operations, and comparisons are the same as :class:`~mlib.maths.vector.Vector`. Since it inherits from om2's MVector, it can be passed directly to ``MFnTransform.setTranslation``, etc. When transforming positions with matrices, use :meth:`mlib.maths.matrix.Matrix.transformPoint` or ``om2.MPoint(t) * m`` (note that ``t * m`` performs transformation excluding translation, i.e., only rotation and scaling)."

