msgid "全キーを移動する。"
msgstr "Move all keys."

msgid "float()に従うため、変換可能な数値文字列やboolもここでは受理する。 キー番号などの厳密なint検証とは別の責務とする。"
msgstr "Following float(), this helper also accepts convertible numeric strings and bool values. This is a separate responsibility from strict int validation of key indices."

msgid "float()へ渡す値。"
msgstr "The value passed to float()."

msgid "有限な値。"
msgstr "A finite value."

msgid "変換できない文字列など、またはNaN/正負の無限大の場合。"
msgstr "The value is an unconvertible string or similar input, NaN, or positive/negative infinity."

msgid "float()が受理しない型の場合。"
msgstr "The type is not accepted by float()."

msgid "boolを除くint。負値による末尾参照は受け付けない。"
msgstr "An int excluding bool. Negative indices do not refer to keys from the end."

msgid "同じ番号を両端に持つ範囲。"
msgstr "A range with the same index at both ends."

msgid "非int、bool、負値、または現在のキー数以上の場合。"
msgstr "If index is not an int, is a bool, is negative, or is greater than or equal to the current key count."

msgid "更新対象カーブ。"
msgstr "Curve to update."

msgid "キー番号。"
msgstr "Key index."

msgid "内部単位の値。"
msgstr "Value in internal units."

msgid "Maya標準の接線型名。"
msgstr "Maya's standard tangent type name."

msgid "入力接線として解釈するか。"
msgstr "Whether to interpret this as an input tangent."

msgid "setKeyでキーを作成・更新するか。"
msgstr "Whether setKey is creating or updating a key."

msgid "正の入力倍率。"
msgstr "Positive input scale."

msgid "出力倍率。"
msgstr "Output scale."

msgid "内部単位の入力オフセット。"
msgstr "Input offset in internal units."

msgid "内部単位の出力オフセット。"
msgstr "Output offset in internal units."

msgid "変換する値。"
msgstr "The value to convert."

msgid "Trueはoutput、Falseはinputの定義を使う。"
msgstr "True uses the output definition; False uses the input definition."

msgid "Trueは内部単位からUI単位、FalseはUI単位から内部単位へ変換する。"
msgstr "True converts internal units to UI units; False converts UI units to internal units."

msgid "単位型に応じた値。無次元のアトリビュートでは値をそのまま使う。"
msgstr "The value in the units appropriate to the unit type. For a unitless attribute, use the value unchanged."

msgid "接続先の合成結果ではなく、このカーブの補間・外挿による値を返す。 空カーブは入力値の変換より先に拒否する。時間出力ではMaya 2022/2023の API返却の版差を補正し、他の版と同じ秒へ揃える。"
msgstr "Return this curve's interpolated or extrapolated value, rather than the combined result at a connected destination. Reject an empty curve before converting the input value. For time outputs, compensate for differences in the API return value in Maya 2022/2023 so that all versions return seconds."

msgid "T型入力は秒、U型入力は無次元。float()で変換し有限性を検査する。"
msgstr "Seconds for T inputs; a unitless value for U inputs. Convert with float() and check finiteness."

msgid "出力型に従うrad/cm/秒、または無次元の評価値。"
msgstr "The evaluated value in rad/cm/seconds, or a unitless value, according to the output type."

msgid "キーが一つもない場合、またはMayaの評価に失敗した場合。"
msgstr "If the curve has no keys, or Maya fails to evaluate it."

msgid "入力が非有限、またはfloat()変換で受理できない場合。"
msgstr "If the input is non-finite or cannot be accepted by float()."

msgid "入力の型がfloat()へ変換できない場合。"
msgstr "If the input type cannot be converted with float()."

msgid "入力T型はMTimeを秒へ変換し、U型は無次元の入力値を返す。 現在のフレーム番号やドライバーPlugのUI表示値へは変換しない。"
msgstr "For T inputs, convert MTime to seconds; for U inputs, return the unitless input values. Do not convert them to current frame numbers or UI display values of the driver Plug."

msgid "新しい入力値リスト。変更してもカーブへ書き戻さない。"
msgstr "A new list of input values. Changing it does not write back to the curve."

msgid "角度はrad、距離はcm、時間は秒、その他は無次元で返す。 時間出力はMFnAnimCurve.value()の版差を避け、time型のキー値Plugから読む。"
msgstr "Return angles in rad, distances in cm, times in seconds, and other values as unitless numbers. For time outputs, read the time-typed key value Plugs to avoid version differences in MFnAnimCurve.value()."

msgid "新しい出力値リスト。変更してもカーブへ書き戻さない。"
msgstr "A new list of output values. Changing it does not write back to the curve."

msgid "角度はMAngleからradへ変換する。接線ウェイトはgetTangentAngleWeight()の 返却値をそのまま使い、一律の距離単位などへ追加変換しない。 lock/weightLockはキー単位、weightedTangentsはカーブ全体の状態である。"
msgstr "Convert angles from MAngle to rad. Use the weights returned by getTangentAngleWeight() unchanged, without further conversion to a common distance unit or similar. lock/weightLock are per-key states; weightedTangents is a curve-wide state."

msgid "0始まりの既存キー番号。別名 ``idx`` も使用可能。"
msgstr "The zero-based index of an existing key. The alias ``idx`` is also available."

msgid "inTangentType/outTangentType、inAngle/outAngle、inWeight/outWeight、     lock、weightLock、weightedTangentsの新しい辞書。型名はMayaコマンド表記で、     未登録のAPI接線型は空文字列。辞書を変更してもカーブは更新しない。"
msgstr "A new dictionary containing inTangentType/outTangentType, inAngle/outAngle, inWeight/outWeight,     lock, weightLock, and weightedTangents. Type names follow Maya command notation;     unregistered API tangent types are represented by an empty string. Changing the dictionary does not update the curve."

msgid "inTangentType/outTangentType、inAngle/outAngle、inWeight/outWeight、"
msgstr "inTangentType/outTangentType, inAngle/outAngle, inWeight/outWeight,"

msgid "lock、weightLock、weightedTangentsの新しい辞書。型名はMayaコマンド表記で、 未登録のAPI接線型は空文字列。辞書を変更してもカーブは更新しない。"
msgstr "lock, weightLock, and weightedTangents in a new dictionary. Type names follow Maya command notation; unregistered API tangent types are represented by an empty string. Changing the dictionary does not update the curve."

msgid "bool、非int、負値、またはキー数以上の番号の場合。"
msgstr "If the index is a bool, is not an int, is negative, or is greater than or equal to the key count."

msgid "横軸を反転するか。"
msgstr "Flip X-axis?"

msgid "縦軸を反転するか。"
msgstr "Flip vertical axis?"

msgid "横軸の反転中心。"
msgstr "X-axis pivot center."

msgid "縦軸の反転中心。"
msgstr "Vertical axis pivot center."

msgid "TrueはAPI直接更新。input=Trueとの併用は未対応。"
msgstr "True updates directly through the API. Cannot be combined with input=True."

msgid "0始まりのキー番号。 別名 ``idx`` も使用可能。"
msgstr "Zero-based key index. The alias ``idx`` is also accepted."

msgid "TrueはAPI 2.0によるUndoなし削除。"
msgstr "True deletes directly through API 2.0 without Undo."

msgid "横軸倍率。0はキーが重なるためValueError。"
msgstr "X-axis scale. 0 causes keys to overlap, resulting in a ValueError."

msgid "縦軸倍率。"
msgstr "Vertical scale factor."

msgid "横軸の基準値。"
msgstr "X-axis reference value."

msgid "縦軸の基準値。"
msgstr "Vertical axis baseline."

msgid "TrueはAPI直接更新。負の入力倍率は更新前に未対応として拒否。"
msgstr "True updates directly through the API. Negative input scales are rejected as unsupported before changes."

msgid "constant/linear/cycle/cycleRelative/oscillate。 Noneは変更しない。"
msgstr "constant/linear/cycle/cycleRelative/oscillate. None means no change."

msgid "preと同じ選択肢。Noneは変更しない。"
msgstr "Same selection as pre. None means no change."

msgid "Trueはom2で直接更新し、Undoなし。既定Falseはcmdsで更新。"
msgstr "True directly updates om2 without Undo. The default False updates with cmds."

msgid "指定した外挿方法が不正な場合。両側を変更前に検証する。"
msgstr "When the specified extrapolation method is invalid. Validate both sides before making changes."

msgid "ノードが無効、または更新先がロック・接続などで書込み不可の場合。"
msgstr "The node is invalid, or the target is write-protected due to lock or connection."

msgid "inputとvalueはfloat()へ変換し、非有限値を更新前に拒否する。 通常は単位を変換してsetKeyframeを呼ぶ。fastの既存キー更新は値・入力接線型・ 出力接線型の順に適用する。新規キーは両接線型を指定して追加し、時間出力の値は 追加後に設定する。後続のAPI失敗で先行変更を自動復元するものではない。"
msgstr "Convert input and value with float() and reject non-finite values before updating. The normal path converts units and calls setKeyframe. For an existing key, fast applies the value, incoming tangent type, and outgoing tangent type in that order. Add a new key with both tangent types specified, then set its value if it has a time output. A later API failure does not automatically restore earlier changes."

msgid "T型入力は秒、U型入力は無次元。"
msgstr "Seconds for T inputs; a unitless value for U inputs."

msgid "出力型に従うrad/cm/秒、または無次元の値。"
msgstr "A value in rad/cm/seconds, or a unitless value, according to the output type."

msgid "Mayaの入力接線型。fastのstepはautoへ補正する。"
msgstr "The Maya incoming tangent type. fast maps step to auto."

msgid "TrueはUndoへ記録しないAPI更新。 Falseは通常更新を行い、Undo設定は変更しない。通常更新は Undo有効時に一つのチャンクへまとめる。"
msgstr "True updates through the API without recording Undo. False uses the normal update path. Neither changes the Undo setting. Normal updates are grouped into one chunk when Undo is enabled."

msgid "自身。fixed接線の角度・ウェイト指定にはsetTangentを使う。"
msgstr "Self. Use setTangent to specify angles and weights for fixed tangents."

msgid "非有限値、またはfastでfixed/global/未知の接線型を指定した場合。"
msgstr "For non-finite values, or if fast is given fixed/global or an unknown tangent type."

msgid "fastで入力接線にstepnextを指定した場合。 キーの追加・値変更より前に拒否する。"
msgstr "If fast is given stepnext for the incoming tangent. Reject it before adding a key or changing its value."

msgid "weightedTangentsを指定した場合はカーブ全体のウェイト付き接線モードだけを適用し、 同時指定したキー別フラグは適用しない。fastでも同時指定値の検証は省略しない。 通常はkeyTangentへ角度をUI単位に換算して渡す。fastはlock、weightLock、 入力側、出力側の順に更新し、後半の失敗による先行変更を自動復元しない。"
msgstr "When weightedTangents is specified, apply only the curve-wide weighted tangent mode; do not apply per-key flags supplied at the same time. fast still validates the simultaneously supplied values. The normal path converts angles to UI units before passing them to keyTangent. fast updates lock, weightLock, the incoming side, and the outgoing side in that order, without automatically restoring earlier changes if a later update fails."

msgid "TrueはAPIで更新しUndoへ記録しない。 Falseは通常更新をUndo有効時にまとめ、Undo設定は変えない。"
msgstr "True updates through the API without recording Undo. False groups normal updates when Undo is enabled. The Undo setting is not changed."

msgid "getTangent()の辞書と同じ9種類の長名フラグ。角度はrad、 接線ウェイトはAPIの値を使う。fastでは角度/ウェイトをfloat()で有限性検査し、 負のウェイトを拒否する。fastの型名は大文字小文字を区別せず、spline表記を使う。 入力stepはautoへ補正する。ロックは自動解除しない。"
msgstr "The same nine long-name flags as the dictionary returned by getTangent(). Angles are in rad; tangent weights use API values. fast converts angles/weights with float(), checks finiteness, and rejects negative weights. fast tangent type names are case-insensitive and use the spline spelling. An incoming step is mapped to auto. Locks are not automatically released."

msgid "キー番号が不正な場合。"
msgstr "If the key index is invalid."

msgid "フラグが空/未知、またはfastで不正値やglobal/未知の接線型を指定した場合。"
msgstr "If flags are empty or unknown, or if fast is given invalid values, global, or an unknown tangent type."

msgid "fastで入力接線にstepnextを指定した場合。 ロック・ウェイトを含む更新より前に拒否する。"
msgstr "If fast is given stepnext for the incoming tangent. Reject it before any updates, including locks and weights."

msgid "横軸の移動量。時間型は秒。"
msgstr "X-axis movement amount. Time type is in seconds."

msgid "縦軸の移動量。内部単位(cm/rad/秒)。"
msgstr "Vertical axis movement amount. Internal units (cm/rad/sec)."

msgid "TrueはAPI直接更新でUndoなし。"
msgstr "True updates directly through the API without Undo."

msgid "自身。空カーブは変更しない。"
msgstr "Self. Empty curves are not modified."

