msgid "class mlib.nodes.distanceBetween.DistanceBetween"
msgstr "class mlib.nodes.distanceBetween.DistanceBetween"

msgid "inMatrix1/2で変換したpoint1/2間の距離を評価する。"
msgstr "Evaluate the distance between point1/2 transformed by inMatrix1/2."

