msgstr "Set up a connection to measure the world distance between two Transform origins."

msgid ":py:obj:`getDistance <mlib.nodes.distanceBetween.DistanceBetween.getDistance>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`getDistance <mlib.nodes.distanceBetween.DistanceBetween.getDistance>`\\ \\(\\)"

msgid "評価済み距離。内部距離単位cm。"
msgstr "Evaluated distance. Internal distance unit is cm."

