msgstr ":py:obj:`setPoints <mlib.nodes.distanceBetween.DistanceBetween.setPoints>`\\ \\(point1\\, point2\\, \\*\\[\\, fast\\]\\)"

msgid "各入力行列の空間における二点を設定する。行列は変更しない。"
msgstr "Set two points in the space of each input matrix. The matrices remain unchanged."

msgid "第一のTransform。ラッパーが解決したDAGパスを使う。"
msgstr "First Transform. Uses the DAG path resolved by the wrapper."

msgid "第二のTransform。"
msgstr "Second Transform."

msgid "既存の行列入力接続を置き換えるか。 別名 ``f`` も使用可能。"
msgstr "Whether to replace an existing matrix input connection. The alias ``f`` is also accepted."

msgid "自身。point1/2は原点にリセットする。"
msgstr "Self. point1/2 are reset to the origin."

msgid "Transform以外を指定した場合。"
msgstr "When anything other than Transform is specified."

msgid "ロックや既存接続により変更できない場合。 途中の変更は自動では戻さず、一回のUndoで戻せる。"
msgstr "Cannot be changed due to lock or existing connections. Changes made in the middle will not be automatically reverted, but can be undone with a single Undo operation."

msgid "第一の点。内部距離単位cm。"
msgstr "First, the internal distance unit is cm."

msgid "第二の点。同じ単位。"
msgstr "Second point. Same units."

msgid "座標が3要素でない、または非有限値の場合。"
msgstr "When the coordinates do not have three elements, or when they are non-finite values."

msgid "アトリビュートロックなどで設定できない場合。"
msgstr "When it is not possible to set via attribute lock or other means."

