msgstr "Prepares transfer values for all targets and checks writability for targets requiring changes before applying them in collection order. Skips writability checks and writes when all three jointOrient components are zero. An empty collection is unchanged. Normal mode can revert the whole operation with one Undo; fast does not record Undo. An editing failure stops with an exception; completed changes are not automatically reverted."

