msgid "ペアの要素数が2でない、または未登録のinfluenceの場合。"
msgstr "When the number of elements in the pair is not 2, or when the influence is not registered."

msgid "ペアが反復可能でない、または未対応の参照型の場合。"
msgstr "When the pair is not iterable, or when the reference type is not supported."

