msgstr ":py:obj:`_closest_euler <mlib.nodes.transform._closest_euler>`\\ \\(quaternion\\, reference\\)"

msgid "回転を reference の回転順序で表し、reference に最も近い等価な解を返す。"
msgstr "Represent the rotation in the reference rotation order and return the nearest equivalent solution to the reference."

msgid ":py:obj:`_match_scale_signs <mlib.nodes.transform._match_scale_signs>`\\ \\(quaternion\\, scale\\, shear\\, references\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`_match_scale_signs <mlib.nodes.transform._match_scale_signs>`\\ \\(quaternion\\, scale\\, shear\\, references\\)"

msgid "分解したスケールの符号の組み合わせを、基準のスケールの符号へ揃える。"
msgstr "Align the combination of the decomposed scale signs to the sign of the reference scale."

msgid ":py:obj:`_transform_attribute <mlib.nodes.transform._transform_attribute>`\\ \\(name\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`_transform_attribute <mlib.nodes.transform._transform_attribute>`\\ \\(name\\)"

msgid "transform ノード型のアトリビュートの MObject を取得する(初回だけ問い合わせて保持する)。"
msgstr "Get the MObject of the transform node type attribute (query only once and keep it)."

msgid "変換する回転。"
msgstr "Converted rotation."

msgid "基準の回転(回転順序と解の選択に使う)。"
msgstr "Standard rotation (used for rotation order and solution selection)."

msgid "reference と同じ回転順序の、reference に最も近い解 (``MEulerRotation.closestSolution``。360 度の周期と、中間軸を反転した別解を考慮する)。"
msgstr "The rotation order that is closest to the reference (the ``MEulerRotation.closestSolution`` solution, considering a 360-degree period and alternative solutions with inverted intermediate axes)."

msgid "2軸のスケールの符号を同時に反転し、残りの軸まわりの 180 度回転で補償しても 行列は変わらない(D を2軸が -1 の対角行列として S·Sh·R = (S·D)·(D·Sh·D)·(D·R))。 行列式の符号は変えられないため、references を先頭から順に調べ、反転が必要な軸が 0 個または 2 個(行列式の符号と合う)の最初の基準に揃える。どの基準とも合わない (奇数個の軸が違う)場合は入力(om2 の規約)のまま返す。"
msgstr "The matrix remains unchanged even if the signs of the 2-axis scales are inverted simultaneously and the remaining axis is compensated by a 180-degree rotation (where D is a diagonal matrix with -1 on the 2 axes, S·Sh·R = (S·D)·(D·Sh·D)·(D·R)). Since the sign of the determinant cannot be changed, we examine the references in order from the beginning and align the first standard that has either 0 or 2 inverted axes (matching the determinant's sign). If none of the standards match (i.e., an odd number of axes differ), we return as is according to the input convention (om2)."

msgid "分解した回転。"
msgstr "Decomposed rotation."

msgid "分解したスケール。"
msgstr "Decomposed scale."

msgid "分解したシアー(XY、XZ、YZ)。"
msgstr "Decomposed shears (XY, XZ, YZ)."

msgid "符号を合わせる基準のスケールの候補。 優先する順に並べる(setScale で要求した値、現在の scale チャンネル値など)。"
msgstr "Scale candidates for the alignment reference. List them in order of priority (values requested by setScale, current scale channel values, etc.)."

msgid "(quaternion, scale, shear)。scale と shear は3要素の tuple。"
msgstr "(quaternion, scale, shear). scale and shear are 3-element tuples."

msgid "joint など transform の派生型も同じアトリビュートの MObject を共有するため、 ``om2.MPlug(node, attribute)`` で名前の検索なしに MPlug を作れる。"
msgstr "Since joint and other transform-derived types share the same MObject for the same attributes, MPlug can be created without name lookup in ``om2.MPlug(node, attribute)``."

msgid "アトリビュートのロング名(``matrix`` / ``worldMatrix`` など)。"
msgstr "Attribute long names (such as ``matrix`` / ``worldMatrix`` etc.)."

msgid "transform ノード型のアトリビュート。"
msgstr "Attribute of the transform node type."

