msgstr "Get the soft minimum value (lower limit of the UI slider) that is set."

msgid ":py:obj:`getSource <mlib.plugs.plug.Plug.getSource>`\\ \\(\\*\\[\\, skipConversionNodes\\, scn\\]\\)"
msgstr ""

msgid "単一の入力元を取得する。子・配列要素の独立接続は展開しない。"
msgstr "Retrieves a single source without expanding independent connections on children or array elements."

msgid ":py:obj:`getType <mlib.plugs.plug.Plug.getType>`\\ \\(\\)"
msgstr ":py:obj:`getType <mlib.plugs.plug.Plug.getType>`\\ \\(\\)"

