msgid "選択・名前空間・参照、導入状態、イベント・遅延実行、 単位変換・独立した汎用計算の型・進捗表示などの共通機能"
msgstr "Shared features include selection, namespaces, references, installation state, events, deferred execution, unit conversion, types for independent general-purpose calculations, and progress display."

