msgstr "``maths``"

msgid "OpenMaya API 2.0 の型を継承した可変の値型。Vector・Translate・Scale・Shear は ``MVector``、Quaternion は ``MQuaternion``、EulerRotate は ``MEulerRotation``、 Matrix は ``MMatrix`` の派生で、om2 の関数へそのまま渡せ、演算の意味も om2 に従う (ハッシュ不可)。``easing`` だけは標準の ``math`` のみを使う"
msgstr "A mutable value type inheriting from OpenMaya API 2.0 types. Vector, Translate, Scale, and Shear inherit from ``MVector``, Quaternion from ``MQuaternion``, EulerRotate from ``MEulerRotation``, and Matrix from ``MMatrix``, all of which can be passed directly to om2 functions with operations following om2 semantics (not hashable). Only ``easing`` uses only standard ``math``."

